# B10: Multi-Source Replica Race Selector & Timeout Circuit-Breaker Aggregator (`ConcurrentAggregator`)

This module implements timeout circuit-breaking logic for multi-replica latency racing (`select_fastest_replica`) and dual-source aggregation (`aggregate_both_sources`).
Preconditions (`requires`) enforce `timeout_ms > 0` and non-negative replica latencies, while `invariant` and `ensures` guarantee that any winning or aggregated latency never exceeds `timeout_ms`.

```jenny
module concurrent_aggregator

pub enum AggError {
    InvalidTimeout,
    NegativeLatency,
    AllReplicasTimedOut,
    SourceTimedOut,
}

pub struct RaceOutcome {
    pub winner_id: i32,
    pub selected_latency_ms: i64,
    pub timeout_ms: i64,

    invariant {
        self.winner_id == 1 || self.winner_id == 2
        self.selected_latency_ms >= 0
        self.selected_latency_ms <= self.timeout_ms
    }
}

pub fn select_fastest_replica(
    primary_latency_ms: i64,
    secondary_latency_ms: i64,
    timeout_ms: i64
) -> RaceOutcome ! AggError
    requires timeout_ms > 0 else AggError.InvalidTimeout
    requires primary_latency_ms >= 0 && secondary_latency_ms >= 0 else AggError.NegativeLatency
    ensures result.selected_latency_ms <= timeout_ms

pub fn aggregate_both_sources(
    val_a: i64,
    lat_a_ms: i64,
    val_b: i64,
    lat_b_ms: i64,
    timeout_ms: i64
) -> i64 ! AggError
    requires timeout_ms > 0 else AggError.InvalidTimeout
    requires lat_a_ms >= 0 && lat_b_ms >= 0 else AggError.NegativeLatency

@example("EX-B10-01: replica race selection and dual-source aggregation within SLA") {
    val race1 = select_fastest_replica(85, 32, 100)!
    assert(race1.winner_id == 2)
    assert(race1.selected_latency_ms == 32)

    val race2 = select_fastest_replica(45, 250, 100)!
    assert(race2.winner_id == 1)
    assert(race2.selected_latency_ms == 45)

    val combined = aggregate_both_sources(100, 40, 250, 75, 100)!
    assert(combined == 350)
}

@example("EX-B10-02: SLA timeout circuit breaking on race and all") {
    val both_slow = select_fastest_replica(150, 220, 100)
    assert(both_slow is AggError.AllReplicasTimedOut)

    val one_slow = aggregate_both_sources(100, 40, 250, 120, 100)
    assert(one_slow is AggError.SourceTimedOut)
}
```
